/TITLE:  NFIZZ
/MARCH 15,1971
/FOR HANDLING GROSS ELECTRODE AND
/FIELD POTENTIALS.
/ANALOGUE CHANNELS 10 AND 14 USED
/CLOCK CHANNEL THREE IS TIME ZERO
/SNS 0-SAMPLE ON CHANNELS 10 AND 14
/      WITH TIME ZERO AT CL3
/SNS 1-ROTATE THROUGH STORED BLOCKS
/     28 IF SINGLE SWEEP,14 IF DUAL
/SNS 2-RECORD VIEWED BLOCK(S) ON UNIT
/     ONE.  RSW 3-11 SELECT BLOCK.
/SNS 3-TAKE BLOCK FROM UNIT 1 TO VIEW.
/     RSW SELECTS BLOCK(S).
/SNS 4-DUAL SWEEP FOR VIEWING,RECORDING,
/     AND RETRIEVING DOUBLE BLOCKS.
/SNS 5-CLEAR ALL STORAGE AREA.
/POT 0-VERT FOR SWEEP 1-CH 10 INPUT.
/POT 4-VERT FOR SWEEP 2-CH14 INPUT.
/POTS 1&2-HORIZONTALS FOR CURSORS.
/POTS 5&6-VERTICAL FOR CURSORS.
/POTS 3&7-VERT AND HORIZ FOR MSEC
/      READOUT.
/LSW 6-8 SELECT SPEED FOR SCANNING
/     BLOCKS.
/RSW 0,1,&2 SELECT MAGNIFICATION OF
/     SWEEP. ALL OFF=8MS SWEEP
/	       2 ON =16MS
/	       1 ON =32MS
/	       0 ON =64MS
/CURSOR READS OFF IN OCTAL MILLISECONDS
/NEVER HIT I/O PRESET START 20
/IF YOU MUST I/O PRESET, START LS 44
